OL,3,AHow 'Lula's Army' WhatsApp chat helped
OL,4,Aturn Brazil election around
OL,5,
OL,6,FA WhatsApp channel created to support
OL,7,FLuiz Inacio Lula da Silva's re-election
OL,8,Fcampaign is being credited by allies
OL,9,Fwith helping deliver one of the most
OL,10,Funlikely comebacks in recent Brazilian
OL,11,Fpolitics.
OL,13,FBrazil's left-wing president had been
OL,14,Ftrailing right-wing challenger Flavio
OL,15,FBolsonaro, but managed to turn the race
OL,16,Faround in just three weeks.
OL,18,FAt a moment when many doubted Lula
OL,19,Fcould reverse the result, a WhatsApp
OL,20,Fchannel called Lula's Army emerged, and
OL,21,Frapidly grew to 10.8 million followers.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
